6.1.2 Label Declaration
-----------------------

A label declaration has the following look:

     label
       LABEL_NAME, ..., LABEL;

   A label declaration part starts with the reserved word `label',
which contains a list of labels.

See also
--------

*Note label::, *Note goto::


