complex values is defined in ISO 10206 Extended Pascal.

Example
-------

     program SqrDemo;

     var
       i: Complex;

     begin
       i := Cmplx (0, 1);
       WriteLn (Re (Sqr (i)) : 0 : 3)  { yields -1.000 }
     end.

